                  "text": "Identification: Implantable material used to reinforce hernia repairs."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Main properties: Material, pore structure, weight, flexibility, absorbability, and coating."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Principle: Mechanical reinforcement and, where applicable, tissue ingrowth."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Main uses: Inguinal, femoral, umbilical, incisional, and selected ventral hernia repairs."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Major risks: Infection, chronic pain, recurrence, seroma, and adhesion-related complications."
                },
